+
+## Full QA pass (desktop, beta) 2026-10-17
+
+The fourth functional pass of the desktop beta site (`/melon-seek/beta/`), beta round 4, by the beta desktop QA agent,
+after the user's 2026-10-16 request: "Whatever was done with the ui/UX it needs to go through the mobile and desktop
+QC QA again". The process log, with every replayable command, is in
+[`docs/process/qa-desktop-beta-4.md`](process/qa-desktop-beta-4.md). No product code was changed.
+
+**Setup**
+- **Build under test:** a local static build of 1ef0646 (what Pages deployed), built with
+  `node scripts/build-static.js --out <scratch>/qa-desktop-beta-4/dist` (7/7 beta companies) and served under
+  `/melon-seek/` by `scripts/cycle/serve.mjs` with a pid file. The live site is not reachable from the sandbox.
+- **Data:** the 2026-10-16 crawl with every board whole: Amazon 22,179, Apple 4,851, Google 3,821, NVIDIA 2,711,
+  Microsoft 2,435, Meta 1,208, Netflix 414; Anduril 2,537 on the main site. All boards are `mode: "snapshot"`.
+- **Browser:** Playwright, Chromium 141. **Desktop Safari is not available here**, so nothing in this section is
+  WebKit. Every other host was aborted, so the map runs without its basemap.
+- **Viewports and themes:** 1440x900, 1280x800 and 1024x768, light and dark.
+- **Method:** counts and order were checked against the app's own data (`api.js` `getJobs()`). The card pay text of
+  all 23,509 paid big-tech postings was computed with the app's own `payPill`, `payHeadline` and `payLabels`, lifted
+  from `public/app.js`, and each finding confirmed on screen.
+- **Load:** other agents ran at the same time (load average 4 to 30); the timing table was taken at load 6 to 7.
+- **Overlap:** the chart-drawing findings in fix-viz-5 (V-33, V-34, V-38, V-41 to V-48, UX-36, UX-40 to UX-43, UX-59,
+  D-43, D-44, A-8), UX-39 (fix-phone-sizes) and the methodology review's open MR-n are re-tested for evidence below,
+  not re-filed.
+
+**New e2e tests:** [`test/e2e/beta-desktop-qa-4.e2e.js`](../test/e2e/beta-desktop-qa-4.e2e.js), registered in
+`scripts/e2e.js`. Run them with `node scripts/e2e.js --grep='^Beta desktop QA 4'`. They serve `BETA_QA_DIST`, else
+the shared `dist/`, and skip without a beta build. Each `[D-n]` test finds its case in the build's own data.
+- **3/9 pass:** the 3 guards (one span on a card and its drawer headline, with the place count under it; the closed
+  filter sheet inert at 1024 px; a pay row tied to no listed place is still listed under Pay by place and inside the
+  card's range, the lead's decision). The 6 failures are exactly `[D-47]` … `[D-52]`.
+
